<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate falls to 3.6 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate falls to 3.6 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 OCT 1996  SEPT 1996    OCT 1995</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	    3.6	 3.9	    4.1</p>
<p> Unemployed			 79,346     84,586	 88,666</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			101,194	N/A	  101,296</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
